<section class="container" style="padding-block:4rem 2rem;max-width:760px;">
  <p class="body-lg reveal" style="margin-bottom:1.5rem;">For decades Meco was successful as a carburettor manufacturer. Today the Bielefeld company specialises in the safe and reliable transfer of fluids — refrigerant, fuel, coolant — with a wide range of custom and standard connection fittings for use worldwide.</p>
  <p class="body-lg reveal reveal-delay-1" style="margin-bottom:1.5rem;">The company's real capital is its deep technical know-how in fluid transfer — something that was barely visible in its previous presence.</p>
</section>

<section class="container" style="padding-block:1rem 4rem;max-width:900px;">
  <h2 class="display-md reveal" style="margin-bottom:1.5rem;">Logo refinement instead of a new logo</h2>
  <p class="body-lg reveal" style="margin-bottom:1.5rem;">Unlike a full relaunch, Meco needed a targeted adjustment: adapting the existing logo to current viewing habits, above all for digital channels — without leaving the logo's essential character. In parallel, corporate design colours and typography were aligned with a more modern overall presence.</p>
